      description:
        'The integration or user was not found (`entity_not_found`); `connected_account_not_found` when `connected_account_id` does not name a connection for this owner and integration; or `multiple_connections_unavailable` when `connection_intent: add` would create an additional connection while additional connections are turned off for the team.',
